  steps:
    1. Pick grid 7x15, choose k in 1-5 ensuring 2k+1 < 15.
    2. Place grey divider at col k.
    3. Scatter 1-5 blue pixels in cols 0..k-1 (at most 1-2 per row).
    4. Compute reflected span [2k - max_bc, 2k - min_bc].
    5. With ~60% probability, place red pixels in mirror slot spanning exactly
